  merchantTextLines:
  - "<wiggle a=.05 f=2>The Lost Greens </wiggle>.... they are dangerous, but without
    someone to hold the line, they\u2019ll only get worse."
  - Survive the nights, push them back. Show this land the fire <shake a=.4>still
    burns</shake>.
  - The days are shorter here. <slide a=.2>Something</slide> is feeding off the dark,
    <wave a=.2 f=1.5>twisting</wave> this land.
  - "Prey is plentiful, though the easiest hunts won\u2019t sustain you forever. "
  - "Sooner or later, you\u2019ll need to venture<slide a=.2> further</slide>, into<wiggle
    a=.05 f=2> wilder</wiggle> grounds."
  showShopAfterDialog: 0
